WEBVTT

1
00:01:47.282 --> 00:01:49.944
Sir... you won the case.
Congratulations!

2
00:01:53.589 --> 00:01:56.149
Sir... please, sir... sir... can you please
tell us how you feel on your win.

3
00:01:56.225 --> 00:01:57.123
Sir...

4
00:01:59.261 --> 00:02:00.193
Take the day off... l'll drive.

5
00:02:53.182 --> 00:02:54.672
Baba, you won again.

6
00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:56.012
Congratulations!

7
00:04:43.859 --> 00:04:46.851
Saru... you're still here.

8
00:04:47.262 --> 00:04:50.129
Hurry up, dear...
they will be here any minute.

9
00:04:50.699 --> 00:04:51.825
Wait.

10
00:04:52.267 --> 00:04:55.065
Mom...
- Go. Go.

11
00:05:03.145 --> 00:05:04.942
The paper has come?

12
00:05:07.816 --> 00:05:10.250
The boy's family are coming from US.

13
00:05:10.819 --> 00:05:13.185
What if they don't like home food?

14
00:05:13.956 --> 00:05:15.480
So?

15
00:05:16.491 --> 00:05:18.857
So... should we order some diet coke?

16
00:05:20.262 --> 00:05:23.823
You can bring instant food
in this house when I am dead!

17
00:05:24.066 --> 00:05:26.626
Okay... leave it... l'm sorry.

18
00:05:26.902 --> 00:05:30.201
serve the house-guests
on fresh banana leaves.

19
00:05:30.272 --> 00:05:31.671
Like we do at home.

20
00:05:31.740 --> 00:05:33.537
They will appreciate it.

21
00:05:34.643 --> 00:05:36.804
They will respect Saru's family...

22
00:05:36.879 --> 00:05:40.144
...her culture and the
value system she belongs to.

23
00:05:49.057 --> 00:05:50.046
Hello.

24
00:05:50.125 --> 00:05:53.094
Yes, yes...
this is Jayram only speaking.

25
00:05:54.096 --> 00:05:55.154
Yes, go on.

26
00:05:55.664 --> 00:05:56.562
Yes.

27
00:05:58.300 --> 00:05:59.665
I see.

28
00:06:02.137 --> 00:06:03.661
I see.

29
00:06:06.942 --> 00:06:07.931
I see...

30
00:06:13.615 --> 00:06:15.606
They've cancelled the visit.

31
00:06:19.221 --> 00:06:20.813
Cancelled?

32
00:06:21.189 --> 00:06:22.656
But why?

33
00:06:22.824 --> 00:06:25.850
His mother made a list of 1 0 girls...

34
00:06:26.495 --> 00:06:28.690
...since the boy was in the US.

35
00:06:29.865 --> 00:06:31.799
He liked the first one he met.

36
00:06:32.768 --> 00:06:35.532
So why hurt our
daughter by coming here.

37
00:06:36.638 --> 00:06:38.196
That's what they said.

38
00:06:40.008 --> 00:06:42.135
Pack Saru's and my lunch.

39
00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:45.145
I'll drop her at the library
and head to the office.

40
00:06:45.213 --> 00:06:46.612
But... office?

41
00:06:46.682 --> 00:06:47.910
Didn't you take a leave today?

42
00:06:47.983 --> 00:06:50.144
There's no occasion
to take a leave anymore.

43
00:06:53.822 --> 00:06:55.756
If the world's on one side,
he'll be on the other side.

44
00:06:55.824 --> 00:06:57.257
He never listens to me for...
- Mom!

45
00:06:57.526 --> 00:06:58.891
The boy didn't turn up...
what does that mean?

46
00:06:58.961 --> 00:07:01.953
Speak softly...
your father will overhear.

47
00:07:02.030 --> 00:07:04.658
Does this mean my marriage
to Sanjay's been postponed again.

48
00:07:04.733 --> 00:07:06.928
Look, Kaveri.
I've told you a thousand times.

49
00:07:07.002 --> 00:07:08.162
Saru is elder to you.

50
00:07:08.236 --> 00:07:09.669
She will get married first.

51
00:07:09.738 --> 00:07:11.467
You cannot get married until then.

52
00:07:11.540 --> 00:07:13.872
Don't argue with me
on this again and again.

53
00:07:13.942 --> 00:07:16.069
Why don't you search
For a boy yourself?

54
00:07:16.144 --> 00:07:18.203
Is it only our responsibility?

55
00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:21.108
There's a difference between searching
for someone and finding someone.

56
00:07:21.483 --> 00:07:23.644
It's not that I don't have crushes.

57
00:07:23.719 --> 00:07:27.120
But if the person doesn't reciprocate,
then what can I do about it?

58
00:07:27.189 --> 00:07:28.520
I'll have to depend on my family...

59
00:07:28.590 --> 00:07:30.990
...to find some suitable
boy and settle me down.

60
00:07:41.169 --> 00:07:42.193
Lift!

61
00:07:43.505 --> 00:07:44.699
Lift!

62
00:07:45.640 --> 00:07:46.732
This lift... too...

63
00:07:46.808 --> 00:07:48.708
Waste of time I tell you.

64
00:07:49.044 --> 00:07:50.204
Come, Saru.

65
00:07:57.219 --> 00:07:59.813
What's going on here...
keeping the lift engaged?

66
00:08:01.623 --> 00:08:03.648
What's this vulgarity in the society?

67
00:08:03.725 --> 00:08:05.818
Others have to get to work.

68
00:08:11.666 --> 00:08:12.598
Come, Saru

69
00:08:28.950 --> 00:08:31.783
We'll need signatures on the deposit
cheque. - What are you doing here?

70
00:08:31.853 --> 00:08:32.547
Mr. Jayram.

71
00:08:32.621 --> 00:08:35.021
I was looking for you in the society,
Mr. Secretary.

72
00:08:35.090 --> 00:08:36.955
Sir, we were booking
the hall for the AGM.

73
00:08:37.025 --> 00:08:38.492
It's alright.

74
00:08:38.693 --> 00:08:41.787
But I tell you what is this
nonsense going on in the society?

75
00:08:41.930 --> 00:08:43.557
This is too much, you see.

76
00:08:43.632 --> 00:08:45.759
I am a founder member of this society.

77
00:08:45.834 --> 00:08:47.631
Yet, that doesn't scare him.

78
00:08:47.702 --> 00:08:49.727
Shirtless... shameless scoundrel.

79
00:08:49.805 --> 00:08:51.796
Sir, you mean that 20/52?

80
00:08:52.140 --> 00:08:54.836
He's a criminal. Yes!

81
00:08:54.910 --> 00:08:57.071
He was jailed at the age of 1 3.

82
00:08:57.145 --> 00:08:58.544
For murder!

83
00:08:58.613 --> 00:09:00.808
Why did you give NOC
to a criminal like him?

84
00:09:00.882 --> 00:09:01.780
We can't stop him.

85
00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:03.784
Sir, it's like this.

86
00:09:03.952 --> 00:09:06.443
The original owner, Ms. Lily...

87
00:09:06.521 --> 00:09:08.614
...she transferred her
flat in this boy's name.

88
00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:10.021
Ms. Lily.
- Yes.

89
00:09:10.092 --> 00:09:11.787
Such a sensible lady.

90
00:09:12.194 --> 00:09:16.096
And she transferred her
home to a road-side rubbish.

91
00:09:16.164 --> 00:09:17.825
Sir, he's no road-side rubbish.

92
00:09:17.899 --> 00:09:19.560
I've heard that his
father is some big-shot.

93
00:09:19.634 --> 00:09:22.102
If you object... he'll brag
about some law or the other.

94
00:09:22.170 --> 00:09:24.104
He's got a good knowledge
about laws and bylaws.

95
00:09:24.172 --> 00:09:25.070
What can we do?

96
00:09:25.140 --> 00:09:27.734
So you let that jail-bird
turned lawyer intimidate you?

97
00:09:27.809 --> 00:09:29.777
And turn our society
into a dance bar.

98
00:09:29.845 --> 00:09:30.971
Sir, what did I do?

99
00:09:31.046 --> 00:09:33.810
How can a secretary stop the parade of
girls from coming and going?

100
00:09:33.882 --> 00:09:37.181
A Secretary's job is to maintain
discipline in the society.

101
00:09:37.252 --> 00:09:39.015
If you can't do it, better resign.

102
00:09:39.087 --> 00:09:40.645
We'll elect someone else.

103
00:09:40.722 --> 00:09:41.780
Come, Saru.

104
00:09:43.792 --> 00:09:46.590
What's my fault in all this?
- Taxi!

105
00:09:49.631 --> 00:09:51.724
Since when did you
start reading love poetry?

106
00:09:57.606 --> 00:09:59.164
Waste product.

107
00:09:59.841 --> 00:10:02.867
Such books don't
increase your IQ level.

108
00:10:24.199 --> 00:10:26.258
Saraswati Parthasaarthy.

109
00:10:31.106 --> 00:10:33.836
The research you gave
me on Market Trends...

110
00:10:33.909 --> 00:10:35.706
Outstanding!

111
00:10:36.144 --> 00:10:37.907
My boss is floored.

112
00:10:38.747 --> 00:10:39.907
Saru...

113
00:10:44.085 --> 00:10:45.950
I need a favor from you.

114
00:10:46.021 --> 00:10:49.684
My office has organized
a Summer-funk party...

115
00:10:49.758 --> 00:10:51.953
...for under-privileged kids.

116
00:10:52.661 --> 00:10:55.858
But the guy who was supposed
to dress up as the bear... fell sick.

117
00:10:56.565 --> 00:10:59.261
So... can you dress
up as the dancing bear?

118
00:11:04.506 --> 00:11:06.064
Please don't say no.

119
00:11:06.808 --> 00:11:08.036
It's for charity.

120
00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:11.176
It's my boss' wife's pet project.

121
00:11:11.546 --> 00:11:14.674
If you say yes...
you'll do me a big favor.

122
00:11:14.749 --> 00:11:15.875
Please.

123
00:11:32.567 --> 00:11:44.104
"Don't ask... about the condition
of my heart... beloved."

124
00:11:45.313 --> 00:11:55.985
"It's immersed in the
intoxication of your love..."

125
00:11:57.025 --> 00:12:00.153
"...the ambiance."

126
00:12:00.562 --> 00:12:04.054
"Don't ask... about the condition
of my heart... beloved."

127
00:12:07.068 --> 00:12:08.797
How did weepy... Saru... become

128
00:12:08.870 --> 00:12:10.565
...a bouncing bear today?

129
00:12:10.972 --> 00:12:12.530
What did Abhimanyu
promise you this time?

130
00:12:12.607 --> 00:12:13.232
A kiss?

131
00:12:13.508 --> 00:12:14.202
A hug?

132
00:12:14.509 --> 00:12:17.603
Or... just holding hands
Would've been enough for you.

133
00:12:17.679 --> 00:12:20.580
And the anonymous Valentine's
day card you sent for Abhimanyu...

134
00:12:20.649 --> 00:12:22.947
...everyone really
liked it in the office.

135
00:12:43.672 --> 00:12:46.937
"When the twilight falls."

136
00:12:47.309 --> 00:12:50.801
"...I think I think of you."

137
00:12:51.146 --> 00:12:54.309
"Brings a storm."

138
00:12:54.582 --> 00:12:58.609
"You're in my memories."

139
00:12:58.687 --> 00:13:05.991
"Every desire is incomplete."

140
00:13:06.061 --> 00:13:12.967
"My heart's lost in mischief."

141
00:13:13.034 --> 00:13:16.834
"The caravan of dreams."

142
00:13:16.905 --> 00:13:20.534
"The series of conversations."

143
00:13:20.608 --> 00:13:25.045
"Follow me everywhere I go."

144
00:13:28.183 --> 00:13:39.185
"Whether day or night,
it's lost in a trance..."

145
00:13:40.095 --> 00:13:43.030
"The ambience."

146
00:13:43.765 --> 00:13:53.970
"Don't ask... about the condition
of my heart... beloved."

147
00:14:05.854 --> 00:14:07.617
Stop taking off your clothes, please!

148
00:14:07.689 --> 00:14:08.621
Oh

149
00:14:08.690 --> 00:14:10.180
Sorry, sorry, sorry... sorry.

150
00:14:11.025 --> 00:14:12.083
I am very sorry!

151
00:14:12.827 --> 00:14:14.192
I am very sorry!

152
00:14:21.236 --> 00:14:23.136
I thought the bear is a guy.

153
00:14:41.823 --> 00:14:43.814
Why don't you take
off that Eskimo suit?

154
00:14:44.559 --> 00:14:46.254
Or else you will
melt in this heat.

155
00:15:24.532 --> 00:15:26.523
Hurry up, please.

156
00:15:48.523 --> 00:15:49.251
Excuse me.

157
00:15:53.061 --> 00:15:54.653
Your... head!

158
00:15:55.897 --> 00:15:57.262
Thanks.

159
00:15:59.834 --> 00:16:02.826
Listen... can you recommend me a book?

160
00:16:03.972 --> 00:16:05.667
Book?

161
00:16:06.474 --> 00:16:07.736
Like what?

162
00:16:08.476 --> 00:16:12.105
Like if someone's been released
from jail after 8 years...

163
00:16:12.180 --> 00:16:13.943
...so what should he read?

164
00:16:14.015 --> 00:16:15.915
Something... like that.

165
00:16:40.675 --> 00:16:48.104
"I wonder how...
you came so close to me..."

166
00:16:48.182 --> 00:16:54.781
"Everyone else feels
alienated from me."

167
00:16:55.757 --> 00:17:02.629
"With every breath
I take... I feel alive."

168
00:17:03.164 --> 00:17:10.093
"Please don't go away now."

169
00:17:10.171 --> 00:17:13.868
"The ambiance is standing still."

170
00:17:13.942 --> 00:17:17.605
"The moments feel blissful."

171
00:17:17.679 --> 00:17:22.480
"I am all alone here."

172
00:17:26.921 --> 00:17:28.912
Never want to see you again.

173
00:17:31.793 --> 00:17:32.987
Buzz off.

174
00:17:41.035 --> 00:17:42.161
Damn you!

175
00:17:44.105 --> 00:17:45.902
I hope you die.

176
00:17:46.941 --> 00:17:49.102
Go to hell. Go to hell.

177
00:17:49.510 --> 00:17:50.875
I'm never going to see him again.

178
00:17:50.945 --> 00:17:52.537
Never! Never! Never!

179
00:17:59.654 --> 00:18:03.954
Saru, Sanjay... has seen
a suitable boy for you.

180
00:18:04.225 --> 00:18:05.817
He's based in Denmark.

181
00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:08.085
Works for Mars Electronics.

182
00:18:08.663 --> 00:18:10.153
He'll come see you tomorrow.

183
00:18:15.036 --> 00:18:17.095
But mom and you are leaving
for Tirupati tomorrow.

184
00:18:17.171 --> 00:18:20.937
Sanjay requested me personally...
so I've given him my permission.

185
00:18:21.709 --> 00:18:23.006
He's a nice guy.

186
00:18:23.578 --> 00:18:25.045
IIT... llM.

187
00:18:25.780 --> 00:18:27.543
And Vaideki Brahmins.

188
00:18:27.749 --> 00:18:29.740
Even the horoscopes
are a perfect match.

189
00:18:29.817 --> 00:18:33.150
But without you two...
my heart doesn't agree.

190
00:18:34.222 --> 00:18:38.852
If things go your way, its good.
If not, it's even better.

191
00:18:39.861 --> 00:18:41.954
Because it's the will of God.

192
00:18:50.972 --> 00:18:51.996
Hi.

193
00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:53.531
Good.

194
00:18:54.809 --> 00:18:55.571
Hi.
- Hi.

195
00:18:55.643 --> 00:18:57.076
Hello.

196
00:18:58.646 --> 00:19:00.113
Tea/coffee?
- No, thanks.

197
00:19:00.181 --> 00:19:02.206
I'll go get Saru.
- Okay.

198
00:19:06.554 --> 00:19:08.647
Come on... quickly.

199
00:19:08.923 --> 00:19:10.686
What's this?

200
00:19:10.925 --> 00:19:12.187
Come on.

201
00:19:13.895 --> 00:19:14.725
Here.

202
00:19:14.796 --> 00:19:17.162
She's my sister Saru.
- Hi.

203
00:19:20.668 --> 00:19:22.795
So nice to have you.

204
00:19:44.158 --> 00:19:45.022
It was a pleasure
meeting you.

205
00:19:45.093 --> 00:19:47.152
Same here.
- Thanks. - Take care.

206
00:19:47.228 --> 00:19:48.923
Thanks.
- And see you later.

207
00:19:55.837 --> 00:19:57.031
See you tomorrow.

208
00:20:00.842 --> 00:20:02.104
Perfect match for you.

209
00:20:02.176 --> 00:20:04.610
Great guy! I really like him!

210
00:20:05.079 --> 00:20:07.775
Hey... he left his phone here.

211
00:20:08.082 --> 00:20:11.108
Come on, Saru. You've a readymade
excuse to meet him again.

212
00:20:11.185 --> 00:20:12.015
Take it.

213
00:20:12.086 --> 00:20:13.178
Come on.

214
00:20:13.521 --> 00:20:15.614
He'll really like it if you
return him his phone. - No, Kaveri.

215
00:20:15.690 --> 00:20:17.282
Come on, go.
- No, no.

216
00:20:20.228 --> 00:20:22.696
Kaveri's calling.
What do I tell her?

217
00:20:24.031 --> 00:20:25.191
What do I tell her what?

218
00:20:26.267 --> 00:20:28.030
You hitched a beauty like Kaveri...

219
00:20:28.136 --> 00:20:30.900
...and sticking me up
with a frump aunt like Saraswati.

220
00:20:31.239 --> 00:20:33.207
Are you my friend or my enemy?

221
00:20:33.307 --> 00:20:36.606
S*** man! I had high hopes with you.

222
00:20:36.978 --> 00:20:39.242
And you're the 1 0th
guy who's rejecting Saru.

223
00:20:40.114 --> 00:20:41.604
There were 9 before me?

224
00:20:41.816 --> 00:20:43.875
When were you going to tell me this?

225
00:20:43.951 --> 00:20:45.646
After getting hooked-booked.

226
00:20:46.254 --> 00:20:49.018
Look... if I want to marry Kaveri...

227
00:20:49.090 --> 00:20:51.615
...I must first find someone
for that encyclopaedia.

228
00:20:51.692 --> 00:20:54.024
Old man Parthasaarthy insists on it.

229
00:20:54.095 --> 00:20:55.892
I am fed up.

230
00:20:56.764 --> 00:20:58.288
I can't help you in this.

231
00:20:58.566 --> 00:21:01.626
Saraswati is your problem, not mine.

232
00:21:05.773 --> 00:21:07.638
Kaveri, you told Sanjay about...

233
00:21:07.708 --> 00:21:09.869
...the number of
boys that rejected me.

234
00:21:09.944 --> 00:21:10.968
How could you?

235
00:21:11.045 --> 00:21:14.708
Even Arun said no, he doesn't
want a frumpy aunt like you.

236
00:21:15.082 --> 00:21:15.946
I know.

237
00:21:16.017 --> 00:21:18.918
And you know what?
Sanjay's given me an ultimatum.

238
00:21:18.986 --> 00:21:21.250
He won't wait until you get married.

239
00:21:21.522 --> 00:21:23.285
He says either we
get married next month...

240
00:21:23.558 --> 00:21:25.150
...and I move to the US with him.

241
00:21:25.226 --> 00:21:27.160
Or... forget him.

242
00:21:27.662 --> 00:21:28.754
I am so sorry.

243
00:21:28.863 --> 00:21:30.228
Don't say sorry.

244
00:21:30.665 --> 00:21:32.895
Smarten up, find a man.

245
00:21:34.135 --> 00:21:35.602
Oh, God!

246
00:21:35.903 --> 00:21:38.701
Who am I asking to smarten up?

247
00:21:38.773 --> 00:21:42.869
You will never change.
You're a fossil.

248
00:21:43.177 --> 00:21:46.078
And I will lose Sanjay
all because of you.

249
00:21:46.147 --> 00:21:48.911
I love Sanjay.
- So we'll sort it out.

250
00:21:48.983 --> 00:21:53.181
How can I live without him?
- Kaveri.

251
00:21:53.254 --> 00:21:55.119
I'll elope with him,
there's no other way.

252
00:21:55.189 --> 00:21:56.622
No, Kaveri.

253
00:21:56.691 --> 00:21:59.888
Kaveri, think about dad...
he's already suffered a heart attack.

254
00:21:59.961 --> 00:22:02.589
If you run away...
he'll be humiliated.

255
00:22:02.663 --> 00:22:04.722
Dad will be heart-broken, Kaveri.

256
00:22:05.233 --> 00:22:06.598
And what about my heart.

257
00:22:06.667 --> 00:22:09.534
Does anyone care if that shatters?
- Of course we do.

258
00:22:09.604 --> 00:22:10.628
I do.

259
00:22:10.705 --> 00:22:13.503
Kaveri, I promise you...

260
00:22:13.574 --> 00:22:15.804
...l'll get you married
to Sanjay before he leaves.

261
