didn't come to the library today.

788
01:05:34.973 --> 01:05:36.201
Okay.

789
01:05:41.146 --> 01:05:45.139
Excuse me. Saru's back?
- No, she's still got flu.

790
01:05:45.217 --> 01:05:48.243
Otherwise Saru taking
a leave... is impossible.

791
01:06:00.298 --> 01:06:03.233
You didn't tell me you had flu.
- It was just a viral.

792
01:06:03.502 --> 01:06:04.969
Nothing serious.

793
01:06:05.804 --> 01:06:08.204
That party boy's
been looking for you.

794
01:06:10.675 --> 01:06:13.200
That... Abhimanyu... What's his name?

795
01:06:15.247 --> 01:06:16.509
Shashtri.

796
01:06:16.581 --> 01:06:17.570
Right.

797
01:06:19.217 --> 01:06:21.185
He didn't have your number.

798
01:06:21.853 --> 01:06:24.481
No. thank God.

799
01:06:24.556 --> 01:06:27.753
Why? Is he bothering you?
- No!

800
01:06:33.498 --> 01:06:35.227
Then why are you avoiding him?

801
01:06:39.070 --> 01:06:40.901
Why are you avoiding him?

802
01:06:41.840 --> 01:06:43.933
Because every time I open
my mouth in front of him...

803
01:06:44.042 --> 01:06:46.533
...I say something idiotic.

804
01:06:47.245 --> 01:06:48.940
Don't ask why?

805
01:06:50.649 --> 01:06:51.843
Why?

806
01:06:56.688 --> 01:06:59.248
You got a job, didn't you?
- What?

807
01:07:00.959 --> 01:07:03.484
This file... You got a job!

808
01:07:04.996 --> 01:07:06.623
Congratulations.

809
01:07:08.733 --> 01:07:11.998
This isn't a file of my
resumes... it's got a list of boys.

810
01:07:12.637 --> 01:07:15.128
All of them are llTs... llMs.

811
01:07:16.508 --> 01:07:18.601
Next week they're coming to see you.

812
01:07:19.578 --> 01:07:21.944
You'll definitely
like someone for sure.

813
01:07:39.097 --> 01:07:40.189
Saru.

814
01:07:40.732 --> 01:07:42.859
Hi.
- Hi.

815
01:07:43.268 --> 01:07:46.533
How's your health now?
- Good.

816
01:07:48.206 --> 01:07:52.108
I've been trying to
meet you for the past few days.

817
01:07:53.645 --> 01:07:57.581
I wanted to ask whether... you're free.

818
01:07:59.117 --> 01:08:00.277
Today?

819
01:08:00.518 --> 01:08:03.146
No! For the next 80-90 years.

820
01:08:03.588 --> 01:08:09.959
If you're free...
we can hang out... together.

821
01:08:14.199 --> 01:08:15.666
What do you...

822
01:08:15.967 --> 01:08:17.491
What do you mean?

823
01:08:18.103 --> 01:08:24.064
That you've trapped this llT... llM...

824
01:08:27.579 --> 01:08:29.809
I know this is very sudden.

825
01:08:30.749 --> 01:08:34.014
But this feeling was just as sudden.

826
01:08:34.886 --> 01:08:40.791
That day when you went on a date,
I didn't like it at all.

827
01:08:43.094 --> 01:08:45.562
And when you got this makeover...

828
01:08:45.630 --> 01:08:48.190
...I hoped that you did it for me.

829
01:08:50.735 --> 01:08:53.067
And when you didn't
come to the office...

830
01:08:53.838 --> 01:08:56.830
...I realised that you...

831
01:08:57.876 --> 01:08:59.741
You're the one, Saru...

832
01:09:02.747 --> 01:09:04.146
Will you...

833
01:09:05.083 --> 01:09:06.675
Will you marry me?

834
01:09:39.784 --> 01:09:40.682
Saru.

835
01:09:40.752 --> 01:09:41.844
What's the emergency?

836
01:09:41.920 --> 01:09:43.581
Good news. Come on.

837
01:09:44.656 --> 01:09:47.853
The no .8 guy in this
file is waiting for you.

838
01:09:47.926 --> 01:09:49.223
Upstairs, in the restaurant.

839
01:09:50.662 --> 01:09:53.028
He's llT... llM... and MIT as well.

840
01:09:53.498 --> 01:09:54.931
Your dad will really love him.

841
01:09:54.999 --> 01:09:57.729
Abhimanyu came to see
me during the lunch break.

842
01:09:59.137 --> 01:10:00.536
You mean that party boy.

843
01:10:02.173 --> 01:10:05.631
That party boy is llT... llM...
- I see.

844
01:10:05.710 --> 01:10:07.268
Brahmin... Shashtri.

845
01:10:07.979 --> 01:10:10.106
Seems like the answer
to your dad's prayers.

846
01:10:10.181 --> 01:10:11.273
Come on.

847
01:10:12.917 --> 01:10:14.817
He wants to marry me.

848
01:10:17.555 --> 01:10:18.852
What do I do?

849
01:10:22.961 --> 01:10:23.985
Say yes.

850
01:10:53.725 --> 01:11:00.255
"My heart fell in the
captivity of memories."

851
01:11:00.331 --> 01:11:07.066
"This love has shattered
it into pieces."

852
01:11:07.138 --> 01:11:13.771
"Our meeting wasn't a coincidence."

853
01:11:13.845 --> 01:11:20.273
"O benefactor.
"O benefactor. "O benefactor."

854
01:11:20.552 --> 01:11:27.082
"Our meeting wasn't a coincidence."

855
01:11:27.158 --> 01:11:34.291
"O benefactor.
"O benefactor. "O benefactor."

856
01:11:42.173 --> 01:11:45.142
Will you please come
along to shop for my wedding?

857
01:11:46.144 --> 01:11:48.044
Everything I selected

858
01:11:48.112 --> 01:11:50.080
...I looked like the old Saru.

859
01:11:50.148 --> 01:11:51.809
Please, Inder.

860
01:11:52.984 --> 01:11:54.713
I want to look beautiful that day.

861
01:12:01.259 --> 01:12:04.695
"You love someone else."

862
01:12:04.762 --> 01:12:07.925
"You think about someone else."

863
01:12:07.999 --> 01:12:13.096
"The heart cannot accept this."

864
01:12:14.706 --> 01:12:18.005
"There's a spark of separation."

865
01:12:18.076 --> 01:12:21.273
"What's this fire?"

866
01:12:21.546 --> 01:12:26.984
"My yearning for you has killed me."

867
01:12:27.051 --> 01:12:33.513
"Our meeting wasn't a coincidence."

868
01:12:33.591 --> 01:12:41.054
"O benefactor.
"O benefactor. "O benefactor."

869
01:13:10.895 --> 01:13:12.920
Hi.
- What's this?

870
01:13:13.698 --> 01:13:15.165
Post marriage,
Abhimanyu is taking up a job...

871
01:13:15.233 --> 01:13:16.825
...in the Turkey bureau.

872
01:13:17.535 --> 01:13:19.867
Blood test was compulsory
for the visa...

873
01:13:19.938 --> 01:13:22.065
...so I had to go to the hospital...
- You're going to Turkey?

874
01:13:32.784 --> 01:13:34.046
First card...

875
01:13:35.253 --> 01:13:36.720
For you!

876
01:13:46.998 --> 01:13:48.966
Inder, if you don't come...

877
01:13:49.801 --> 01:13:51.769
...l'll have no one
who will be my own.

878
01:13:56.040 --> 01:13:59.271
"This void will stay with me..."

879
01:13:59.544 --> 01:14:02.707
"...no matter where I go."

880
01:14:02.780 --> 01:14:07.717
"I can't be patient."

881
01:14:09.153 --> 01:14:15.956
"In this colorless world of mine..."

882
01:14:16.027 --> 01:14:21.693
"...I wonder why your
name gives me relief."

883
01:14:21.766 --> 01:14:28.035
"Our meeting wasn't a coincidence."

884
01:14:28.106 --> 01:14:29.198
Sir...

885
01:14:29.273 --> 01:14:31.798
Sir... Saru's wedding card.

886
01:14:32.877 --> 01:14:35.971
Sir... the guy's llT... just
like you wanted.

887
01:14:37.081 --> 01:14:40.573
Sir, if you don't come... she'll
have no one of her own at her wedding.

888
01:14:41.819 --> 01:14:43.753
Sir, please take it.

889
01:14:44.122 --> 01:14:50.994
"Our meeting wasn't a coincidence."

890
01:14:51.062 --> 01:14:57.661
"O benefactor.
"O benefactor. "O benefactor."

891
01:14:57.735 --> 01:15:04.072
"My heart fell in the
captivity of memories."

892
01:15:04.142 --> 01:15:10.843
"This love has shattered
it into pieces."

893
01:15:10.915 --> 01:15:17.616
"Our meeting wasn't a coincidence."

894
01:15:17.688 --> 01:15:25.652
"O benefactor.
"O benefactor. "O benefactor."

895
01:15:39.010 --> 01:15:41.501
Hello, where's the groom?

896
01:15:41.579 --> 01:15:43.012
Come, Saru.

897
01:15:43.714 --> 01:15:45.978
He's picking up his parents
from the airport. He'll be here soon.

898
01:15:53.624 --> 01:15:57.651
I'll go get Abhimanyu.
- Yeah.

899
01:16:04.168 --> 01:16:07.069
Congratulations.
- Thank you.

900
01:16:49.647 --> 01:16:53.276
Inder... the registrar's calling.

901
01:17:00.024 --> 01:17:02.185
Yes, mister. Where's the guy?

902
01:17:02.460 --> 01:17:04.553
How much longer will I have to wait?

903
01:17:04.629 --> 01:17:07.029
Sir, he must be stuck in
traffic... that's why he's late.

904
01:17:07.098 --> 01:17:08.497
He'll be here any minute.

905
01:17:08.733 --> 01:17:10.200
This is too much, mister.

906
01:17:10.468 --> 01:17:12.993
He's already 40 minutes late.

907
01:17:13.070 --> 01:17:14.901
There are other people
waiting outside.

908
01:17:14.972 --> 01:17:20.569
Do me a favour, step out so that I can
marry those whose groom have arrived,

909
01:18:04.822 --> 01:18:05.880
Come in.

910
01:18:07.625 --> 01:18:10.617
Did someone die
that you didn't turn up?

911
01:18:13.898 --> 01:18:15.525
Why, Abhimanyu?

912
01:18:20.705 --> 01:18:22.696
My parents have said no
to this marriage.

913
01:18:25.776 --> 01:18:27.107
I am sorry.

914
01:18:30.147 --> 01:18:31.079
Inder...

915
01:18:33.484 --> 01:18:35.247
...he doesn't want to marry me.

916
01:18:44.495 --> 01:18:46.895
If there's a misunderstanding,
then let's sit down and clear it.

917
01:18:48.132 --> 01:18:51.192
The registrar's still waiting.
You two can still get married.

918
01:18:51.736 --> 01:18:54.830
What marriage? What are you saying?

919
01:18:55.239 --> 01:18:57.070
You should punch him!

920
01:18:57.141 --> 01:18:58.870
Punch him!
Punch him!

921
01:18:58.943 --> 01:19:00.808
Punch him!
Punch him!

922
01:19:00.845 --> 01:19:01.834
Punch him!
Punch him!

923
01:19:01.912 --> 01:19:03.004
Punch him!

924
01:19:08.486 --> 01:19:09.714
Saru!

925
01:19:11.222 --> 01:19:13.986
Abhimanyu! Just a minute!

926
01:19:23.734 --> 01:19:28.137
A girl whose last rites have been performed
by the family while she's still alive...

927
01:19:28.673 --> 01:19:30.937
...we cannot accept
such a girl in our family.

928
01:19:31.175 --> 01:19:32.972
It's impossible.

929
01:19:33.044 --> 01:19:34.739
We're not so liberal minded.

930
01:19:35.513 --> 01:19:38.710
Today when Abhimanyu told
us about it at the airport...

931
01:19:38.783 --> 01:19:40.774
...we made it clear to him...

932
01:19:40.851 --> 01:19:43.081
This marriage isn't possible.

933
01:19:43.688 --> 01:19:47.886
And if he goes ahead... then
we won't be a part of it.

934
01:20:04.608 --> 01:20:09.068
You said that... their
approval is just a formality.

935
01:20:11.816 --> 01:20:13.943
If you say yes... they'll say yes.

936
01:20:38.175 --> 01:20:39.802
You should've punched him.

937
01:20:40.644 --> 01:20:41.838
Why didn't you?

938
01:20:42.146 --> 01:20:43.579
Why didn't you punch him?

939
01:20:43.647 --> 01:20:44.909
Why didn't you?

940
01:20:45.149 --> 01:20:46.639
Why didn't you punch him?

941
01:20:46.751 --> 01:20:48.013
Why didn't you punch him?

942
01:20:49.053 --> 01:20:51.613
If I had punched him... it
would've ended everything.

943
01:20:54.258 --> 01:20:57.955
And... you wouldn't
get a second chance...

944
01:20:58.028 --> 01:20:59.017
...to say sorry, I love you.

945
01:20:59.096 --> 01:21:00.063
Sorry...

946
01:21:00.131 --> 01:21:02.156
He doesn't deserve sorry, I love you.

947
01:21:02.233 --> 01:21:04.258
He doesn't deserve a second chance.

948
01:21:04.535 --> 01:21:07.265
All this that you're doing...

949
01:21:07.538 --> 01:21:08.971
...he doesn't deserve all this.

950
01:21:09.039 --> 01:21:11.234
He doesn't deserve it.
He doesn't deserve anything.

951
01:21:11.509 --> 01:21:13.136
He doesn't deserve anything.

952
01:21:27.658 --> 01:21:36.965
"My restlessness would get some peace"

953
01:21:37.568 --> 01:21:45.065
"Whenever I see your face"

954
01:21:45.643 --> 01:21:53.311
"Whenever I see your face"

955
01:21:53.884 --> 01:22:03.020
"My madness gets some patience."

956
01:22:03.661 --> 01:22:11.261
"Whenever I see your face"

957
01:22:11.669 --> 01:22:17.198
"Every time someone
mentions your name."

958
01:22:17.675 --> 01:22:26.105
"My love for you starts flowing
from my eyes like tears."

959
01:22:31.789 --> 01:22:33.723
Mr. And Mrs. Abhimanyu Shastri.

960
01:22:33.791 --> 01:22:35.053
Congratulations.

961
01:22:35.125 --> 01:22:36.524
This is your honeymoon suite.

962
01:22:36.594 --> 01:22:37.219
Enjoy your stay.

963
01:22:37.294 --> 01:22:38.727
Saru, wait a minute.

964
01:22:39.930 --> 01:22:41.295
Saru, stop this.

965
01:22:41.699 --> 01:22:43.064
Stop what, Inder.

966
01:22:43.300 --> 01:22:44.995
Two days advance
has already been paid.

967
01:22:45.069 --> 01:22:46.127
Why waste it?

968
01:22:46.203 --> 01:22:48.103
And anyway,
I can't go back to the house.

969
01:22:48.672 --> 01:22:50.731
You can go, if you want to.

970
01:22:51.942 --> 01:22:53.603
Go.
- Saru...

971
01:23:00.784 --> 01:23:04.743
"Day and night I pray
for only one thing."

972
01:23:04.822 --> 01:23:08.519
"That I love and die for you."

973
01:23:08.859 --> 01:23:12.488
"Every time I look around,
I see only you."

974
01:23:12.563 --> 01:23:16.761
"And I want to surrender
my world to you."

975
01:23:16.834 --> 01:23:22.500
"Every time someone
mentions your name."

976
01:23:22.873 --> 01:23:31.212
"I can feel your lips on mine."

977
01:23:31.282 --> 01:23:40.850
"All my paths find their destination."

978
01:23:41.091 --> 01:23:48.930
"Whenever I see your face"

979
01:23:49.133 --> 01:23:57.040
"Whenever I see your face"

980
01:24:01.745 --> 01:24:06.079
See Inder... even though
I have become beautiful...

981
01:24:06.750 --> 01:24:09.480
...no one wants to marry me.

982
01:24:41.919 --> 01:24:44.080
You'll hate me for
this tomorrow, Saru.

983
01:24:44.722 --> 01:24:46.246
Please.

984
01:24:50.694 --> 01:24:58.567
"The tasteless winds just gave me
a whiff of your scent."

985
01:24:58.802 --> 01:25:02.863
"Love is a dangerous thing."

986
01:25:02.940 --> 01:25:06.671
"Someday it will kill me."

987
01:25:06.744 --> 01:25:12.205
"Every time someone
mentions your name."

988
01:25:12.816 --> 01:25:20.951
"Every moment narrates your tale."

989
01:25:21.191 --> 01:25:30.691
"Every yearning of
mine gets comforted.

990
01:25:31.001 --> 01:25:38.965
"Whenever I see your face"

991
01:25:39.043 --> 01:25:47.849
"Whenever I see your face"

992
01:27:03.761 --> 01:27:05.592
"Abhimanyu came to see me."

993
01:27:06.163 --> 01:27:10.224
"I don't know whether
I should say sorry, thanks..."

994
01:27:10.501 --> 01:27:11.729
"...or goodbye."

995
01:27:41.231 --> 01:27:42.528
Hello.

996
01:27:47.671 --> 01:27:48.763
Please be seated.

997
01:28:00.784 --> 01:28:03.082
Kaveri's getting married on the 27 th.

998
01:28:07.624 --> 01:28:09.956
Saru doesn't answer my phone.

999
01:28:13.530 --> 01:28:16.226
Can you please give her this card?

1000
01:28:16.500 --> 01:28:18.934
I've stopped seeing Saru.

1001
01:28:43.193 --> 01:28:45.058
And I am leaving this city.

1002
01:28:51.535 --> 01:28:54.561
Alright, son. See you.

1003
01:28:58.842 --> 01:28:59.831
I will...

1004
01:29:01.144 --> 01:29:02.975
I will give this card to Saru.

1005
01:29:09.052 --> 01:29:10.815
Take care of yourself.

1006
01:29:18.795 --> 01:29:21.195
Saraswati.
- She doesn't work here anymore.

1007
01:29:23.634 --> 01:29:26.000
Any information about her?
- No.

1008
01:29:30.641 --> 01:29:31.835
Excuse me.

1009
01:29:32.576 --> 01:29:34.908
Can you give this
to Abhimanyu Shashtri?

1010
01:29:35.112 --> 01:29:36.670
Thanks.

1011
01:29:49.026 --> 01:29:50.220
Inder.

1012
01:29:53.630 --> 01:29:55.222
I can't give this card to Saru?

1013
01:29:59.102 --> 01:29:59.932
Why?

1014
01:30:00.003 --> 01:30:03.166
Since our marriage broke up,
we're not in touch.

1015
01:30:04.541 --> 01:30:05.565
That's a lie.

1016
01:30:07.277 --> 01:30:09.871
You came to see her at the resort...
she was with you.

1017
01:30:09.947 --> 01:30:11.209
I saw it myself.

1018
01:30:13.183 --> 01:30:15.708
Yes, I did come.
We had some personal conversation.

1019
01:30:16.753 --> 01:30:18.880
After that she went her way,
and I went mine.

1020
01:30:25.028 --> 01:30:26.256
What do you mean by 'her way'?

1021
01:30:27.264 --> 01:30:28.925
She must have given you some address?

1022
01:30:29.666 --> 01:30:30.564
No.

1023
01:30:31.034 --> 01:30:32.661
Any message for her family.

1024
01:30:37.574 --> 01:30:38.563
I am sorry.

1025
01:30:42.312 --> 01:30:43.745
Abhimanyu.

1026
01:30:46.583 --> 01:30:48.016
Any message for me?

1027
01:30:48.785 --> 01:30:49.979
No!

1028
01:31:44.674 --> 01:31:45.971
I have a gun.

1029
01:31:47.177 --> 01:31:49.805
And next time you go
anywhere without telling me...

1030
01:31:49.880 --> 01:31:52.747
...l'll put all six
bullets here and here!

1031
01:31:53.717 --> 01:31:54.945
Get it?

1032
01:31:55.018 --> 01:31:55.985
What?

1033
01:31:56.686 --> 01:31:57.778
What?

1034
01:31:58.922 --> 01:32:01.186
Won't you even say hello?
- No.

1035
01:32:04.661 --> 01:32:06.151
Why not?

1036
01:32:08.098 --> 01:32:11.534
Because after a sympathy fling,
you don't say hello.

1037
01:32:11.835 --> 01:32:12.927
You avoid each other.

1038
01:32:13.270 --> 01:32:16.137
I see... so that's why you're running.

1039
01:32:16.540 --> 01:32:17.905
Because you're embarrassed.

1040
01:32:17.974 --> 01:32:19.566
Saru, grow up.

1041
01:32:19.643 --> 01:32:23.170
I didn't run. I messaged you.

1042
01:32:23.747 --> 01:32:25.840
Didn't you get it? Huh!

1043
01:32:31.054 --> 01:32:34.023
I did... and I let you go because...

1044
01:32:34.091 --> 01:32:37.788
...I thought you're starting
a life with that Abhimanyu.

1045
01:32:38.862 --> 01:32:43.265
Saru... why are you
wandering in the jungles?

1046
01:32:44.768 --> 01:32:46.793
Why are you wandering
in the jungles like a hippie?

1047
01:32:47.270 --> 01:32:48.259
Tell me...

1048
01:32:48.872 --> 01:32:50.931
Who are you to ask me that?

1049
01:32:56.546 --> 01:33:01.006
Saru. You tell me...
who am I to you after that night?

1050
01:33:01.551 --> 01:33:03.644
The night's gone...
the matter's over, Inder

1051
01:33:06.556 --> 01:33:08.046
Whatever happened that night...

1052
01:33:08.625 --> 01:33:10.991
...was only a moment
to forget Abhinamyu.

1053
01:33:11.595 --> 01:33:13.187
It wasn't anything special.

1054
01:33:13.263 --> 01:33:15.163
It wasn't anything wow!

1055
01:33:16.500 --> 01:33:17.558
Get it?

1056
01:33:19.136 --> 01:33:21.161
Now just leave me alone.

1057
01:33:22.806 --> 01:33:24.205
Leave me alone.

1058
01:34:11.855 --> 01:34:13.720
Now tell me who I am.

1059
01:34:14.558 --> 01:34:16.822
Tell me who I am to you.

1060
01:34:17.060 --> 01:34:18.618
Saru?

1061
01:34:18.695 --> 01:34:20.060
Saru?

1062
01:34:20.664 --> 01:34:22.097
Saru?

1063
01:34:22.699 --> 01:34:23.859
Saru?

1064
01:34:33.510 --> 01:34:36.604
I strictly forbade Saraswati
from going to high altitudes.

1065
01:34:36.680 --> 01:34:38.113
She's got Meningioma.

1066
01:34:39.549 --> 01:34:41.676
A deep tumor in the brain.

1067
01:34:41.985 --> 01:34:43.850
We can't operate on it.

1068
01:34:43.920 --> 01:34:46.013
And nor can we do chemo.

1069
01:34:46.089 --> 01:34:48.523
That's why we're treating
her with oral medicines.

1070
01:34:49.125 --> 01:34:52.151
In such cases,
diagnoses is also difficult.

1071
01:34:52.229 --> 01:34:53.890
Because there are
no visible symptoms...

1072
01:34:53.964 --> 01:34:55.795
...other than headache and fever.

1073
01:34:55.865 --> 01:34:57.856
And I had explained
this to Saru and her fianc.

1074
01:34:57.934 --> 01:34:59.231
Hold on.

1075
01:35:00.036 --> 01:35:02.004
Abhimanyu.
- Yeah.

1076
01:35:06.776 --> 01:35:08.141
Yes, Mr. Mehta.

1077
01:35:13.617 --> 01:35:15.847
You broke-off with
her because of her illness.

1078
01:35:15.919 --> 01:35:19.116
I received the reports just few
hours after I broke off the marriage.

1079
01:35:19.856 --> 01:35:21.153
If I had known about this earlier...

1080
01:35:21.224 --> 01:35:23.192
...I would've never hurt Saru.

1081
01:35:24.694 --> 01:35:28.790
My office conducted some
routine medical tests for the visa.

1082
01:35:28.999 --> 01:35:32.730
That's why the doctor
called me first, not Saru.

1083
01:35:34.170 --> 01:35:36.195
I am not proud of myself.

1084
01:35:37.140 --> 01:35:39.802
I kept looking for Saru
all night with the reports.

1085
01:35:39.876 --> 01:35:42.208
Next day when I met her
at the Resort I said sorry.

1086
01:35:42.279 --> 01:35:44.179
Asked for a second chance.

1087
01:35:44.848 --> 01:35:46.110
But she didn't agree.

1088
01:35:48.184 --> 01:35:50.152
She said that I was lucky...

1089
01:35:50.220 --> 01:35:51.653
If I hadn't broke off the marriage...

1090
01:35:51.721 --> 01:35:54.747
...then I would have been stuck with
a wife with tumor.

1091
01:36:03.500 --> 01:36:07.061
I came asking you whether
she left a message for me or not...

1092
01:36:07.671 --> 01:36:08.968
Remember?

1093
01:36:09.506 --> 01:36:10.803
Why did you lie to me?

1094
01:36:13.076 --> 01:36:15.135
You won't tell Inder anything.

1095
01:36:16.112 --> 01:36:18.137
That's one promise she took from me.

1096
01:36:19.082 --> 01:36:21.175
Otherwise... I would've
told you everything.

1097
01:36:22.018 --> 01:36:24.748
You can break a marriage,
but not a promise.

1098
01:36:27.657 --> 01:36:29.124
How is Saru?

1099
01:36:33.096 --> 01:36:34.825
Even if you know, what will you do?

1100
01:37:05.729 --> 01:37:07.128
Excuse me, sir.

1101
01:37:07.897 --> 01:37:09.558
The patient's stuff.

1102
01:37:41.131 --> 01:37:42.826
Thank you.

1103
01:38:18.701 --> 01:38:21.135
Will you make me sit at
the party with the saline?

1104
01:38:23.006 --> 01:38:26.066
Did you threaten the doctor
with a gun to convince him?

1105
01:38:30.046 --> 01:38:31.240
Where's the party?

1106
01:38:37.854 --> 01:38:39.116
It's a surprise.

1107
01:38:41.124 --> 01:38:42.785
I like surprises.

1108
01:39:44.554 --> 01:39:50.857
"My heart's only loved you."

1109
01:39:50.927 --> 01:39:57.059
"You're the only one I prayed for."

1110
01:39:57.233 --> 01:40:02.500
"Your absence is like a curse."

1111
01:40:03.706 --> 01:40:08.973
"Your absence is like a curse."

1112
