"Sweetheart I swear on you."

1118
01:40:35.905 --> 01:40:38.897
"Sweetheart I swear on you."

1119
01:40:38.975 --> 01:40:42.308
"Sweetheart I swear on you."

1120
01:40:57.060 --> 01:40:59.858
Dad's looking so handsome, isn't he?

1121
01:41:01.731 --> 01:41:03.892
Mom got that antique necklace...

1122
01:41:05.134 --> 01:41:07.227
She was asking for it for so long.

1123
01:41:11.207 --> 01:41:13.732
That's my uncle from Vizag.

1124
01:41:14.944 --> 01:41:16.138
My father's brother.

1125
01:41:18.281 --> 01:41:20.181
Whenever he says something...

1126
01:41:20.249 --> 01:41:23.013
...at the end of every
sentence he does this...

1127
01:41:25.254 --> 01:41:28.815
Look... look... he did it again...
he does it all the time.

1128
01:41:30.927 --> 01:41:37.127
"My heart's... addicted to you."

1129
01:41:37.200 --> 01:41:43.105
"Don't ever... betray me."

1130
01:41:43.272 --> 01:41:49.108
"I am used to you... it's not my fault."

1131
01:41:49.178 --> 01:41:55.606
"Without you... it's impossible to live."

1132
01:41:55.685 --> 01:42:01.954
"You're the only one I prayed for."

1133
01:42:02.025 --> 01:42:06.860
"Your absence is like a curse."

