1139
01:42:30.820 --> 01:42:33.846
"Sweetheart I swear on you."

1140
01:42:33.923 --> 01:42:37.120
"Sweetheart I swear on you."
- Thank you.

1141
01:42:37.193 --> 01:42:39.855
"Sweetheart I swear on you."

1142
01:42:41.698 --> 01:42:42.892
Marry me, Saru.

1143
01:42:49.005 --> 01:42:51.030
Charity marriage...

1144
01:42:52.041 --> 01:42:53.167
No, thank you.

1145
01:42:55.878 --> 01:42:57.038
Saru.

1146
01:42:58.047 --> 01:42:59.241
Saru, please.

1147
01:42:59.949 --> 01:43:01.644
It's not your responsibility...

1148
01:43:01.718 --> 01:43:02.844
...to fulfill every
incomplete story of mine, Inder.

1149
01:43:02.919 --> 01:43:03.908
Then whose is it?

1150
01:43:04.554 --> 01:43:05.851
Stop it, please.

1151
01:43:07.056 --> 01:43:10.253
I am not your first choice
Neither am I your best choice...

1152
01:43:10.526 --> 01:43:11.720
You're my only...

1153
01:43:18.000 --> 01:43:21.766
If you ask again, I'll say yes.

1154
01:43:26.042 --> 01:43:28.533
I'll stoop really low in my own view.

1155
01:43:32.682 --> 01:43:34.707
I want to die with pride...

1156
01:43:39.522 --> 01:43:41.285
Give me your hand.

1157
01:43:41.824 --> 01:43:43.155
You can't die.

1158
01:43:50.967 --> 01:43:57.964
Go always grants
parents wish for the child.

1159
01:43:59.075 --> 01:44:01.509
Putting a garland on a photo
is a curse and not a wish...

1160
01:44:01.577 --> 01:44:03.977
...and no God ever fulfils a curse.

1161
01:44:08.484 --> 01:44:09.883
Blessings or a curse...

1162
01:44:11.854 --> 01:44:14.186
Whatever the parents wish for
from their hearts...

1163
01:44:18.127 --> 01:44:19.754
...God says O.K.

1164
01:44:19.829 --> 01:44:21.558
What okay...

1165
01:44:23.199 --> 01:44:25.133
Enough, Saru.

1166
01:44:25.701 --> 01:44:26.827
Enough.

1167
01:44:28.137 --> 01:44:30.037
Let's go to the hospital.

1168
01:45:13.816 --> 01:45:15.511
Oh my... what's he doing?

1169
01:45:15.585 --> 01:45:16.574
Jayram!

1170
01:45:16.652 --> 01:45:17.550
Jayram!

1171
01:45:17.620 --> 01:45:18.609
Come quickly!

1172
01:45:18.688 --> 01:45:19.177
Jayram!

1173
01:45:21.757 --> 01:45:24.021
Rascal! What is this?

1174
01:45:24.126 --> 01:45:25.718
What hooliganism is this?

1175
01:45:26.162 --> 01:45:27.527
Call the police!

1176
01:45:43.746 --> 01:45:45.771
Stop putting a wreath on her photo.

1177
01:45:46.649 --> 01:45:49.584
Otherwise... what will you do?

1178
01:45:50.253 --> 01:45:51.845
What can you do?

1179
01:45:58.060 --> 01:46:00.085
I'll come back so
you can slap me again.

1180
01:46:02.999 --> 01:46:04.466
Goodbye.

1181
01:46:26.222 --> 01:46:27.746
Hey... buddy.

1182
01:46:28.758 --> 01:46:30.623
Wake up, its morning.

1183
01:46:32.128 --> 01:46:33.060
Come on.

1184
01:46:37.800 --> 01:46:39.700
I told you I've got my eyes on you.

1185
01:46:42.138 --> 01:46:43.969
You're the star of the society.

1186
01:46:45.174 --> 01:46:46.698
There are many complaints against you.

1187
01:46:49.245 --> 01:46:51.145
Did you drink all this alone?

1188
01:46:52.048 --> 01:46:53.140
Surprising.

1189
01:46:53.215 --> 01:46:55.615
Come on, I'll get you
some tea at the police station.

1190
01:47:00.856 --> 01:47:02.847
There's a bit of improvement.

1191
01:47:04.894 --> 01:47:06.862
I'm discharging you
only because you're asking.

1192
01:47:07.463 --> 01:47:09.454
But make sure you come
for your checkups every day.

1193
01:47:09.532 --> 01:47:10.897
Okay.

1194
01:47:12.068 --> 01:47:13.501
Where's your friend?

1195
01:47:15.471 --> 01:47:17.803
Normally he's always
here during visiting hours.

1196
01:47:18.174 --> 01:47:19.505
So what happened today?

1197
01:47:26.816 --> 01:47:28.579
Sir, please let me make a call.

1198
01:47:30.586 --> 01:47:31.610
Sir.

1199
01:47:33.789 --> 01:47:34.915
Sir, please, sir.

1200
01:48:04.587 --> 01:48:05.884
Sir, I need to call the hospital.

1201
01:48:05.955 --> 01:48:07.217
Rode, do something about him.

1202
01:48:07.556 --> 01:48:09.217
Hey... sit down?

1203
01:48:09.725 --> 01:48:11.158
You're not on a visit here.

1204
01:48:11.494 --> 01:48:12.620
Sit.

1205
01:48:15.598 --> 01:48:18.465
Let me use the phone, otherwise...
- Otherwise what?

1206
01:48:19.001 --> 01:48:20.730
Otherwise what?

1207
01:48:20.936 --> 01:48:22.767
I would've put you behind bars,
you know.

1208
01:48:24.106 --> 01:48:26.904
There are numerous complaints
against you from the society.

1209
01:48:28.544 --> 01:48:30.671
Moreover,
you also have a criminal record.

1210
01:48:33.516 --> 01:48:36.178
And now you threaten the inspector
on duty in the police station.

1211
01:48:36.519 --> 01:48:37.247
Otherwise...

1212
01:48:38.721 --> 01:48:40.120
Otherwise... you'll do what?

1213
01:48:41.624 --> 01:48:44.252
Sir... I just want to make a call.
- Rode, throw him behind bars.

1214
01:48:45.494 --> 01:48:47.553
It's Saturday,
he won't get bail until Monday.

1215
01:48:47.630 --> 01:48:49.188
Please sir,
it's a very important call.

1216
01:48:49.265 --> 01:48:50.163
Let him rot inside for a day or two.

1217
01:48:50.232 --> 01:48:52.723
Sir... sir...
- Stop bothering sir.

1218
01:48:52.802 --> 01:48:53.860
Please tell your sir...

1219
01:48:54.203 --> 01:48:55.898
Just one phone call.
Please tell him...

1220
01:48:55.971 --> 01:48:56.767
Just one call to the hospital.

1221
01:48:57.506 --> 01:48:59.133
Listen...

1222
01:49:01.911 --> 01:49:03.173
I will call.

1223
01:49:03.946 --> 01:49:05.709
Stop...

1224
01:49:06.082 --> 01:49:08.744
Who are you calling? Your father?

1225
01:49:08.884 --> 01:49:10.511
Stop...

1226
01:49:20.863 --> 01:49:21.852
Bharti, get the car.

1227
01:49:28.637 --> 01:49:30.571
I want to issue this book.

1228
01:50:02.805 --> 01:50:04.966
If someone's released
from jail after 8 years...

1229
01:50:05.040 --> 01:50:06.735
...then what should he read...

1230
01:50:09.979 --> 01:50:12.140
"Bear girl... Coffee?"

1231
01:50:27.029 --> 01:50:28.656
"No coffee?"

1232
01:50:28.898 --> 01:50:30.798
"Then how about a tequila?"

1233
01:50:57.159 --> 01:50:59.184
"Today after meeting
a girl in the lift..."

1234
01:50:59.261 --> 01:51:01.695
"...i felt like I found
the best choice of my life."

1235
01:51:02.231 --> 01:51:04.131
"I stay away from girls that cry."

1236
01:51:04.900 --> 01:51:09.166
"But when you cry...
I want to just... kiss you."

1237
01:51:09.738 --> 01:51:10.966
"So can I?"

1238
01:51:28.023 --> 01:51:30.184
"It's been 27 days and 9 hours
since I met you."

1239
01:51:30.759 --> 01:51:32.784
"But you haven't replied yet."

1240
01:51:33.596 --> 01:51:35.086
"So I guess it's a no, thank you."

1241
01:51:35.831 --> 01:51:39.631
"But... if you ever change your mind,
call me."

1242
01:52:24.213 --> 01:52:29.150
Stop.
- Wait...

1243
01:53:16.832 --> 01:53:20.097
You ran with a death wish...
To say what?

1244
01:53:20.903 --> 01:53:22.530
Sorry or I love you?

1245
01:53:34.917 --> 01:53:36.111
Wait...

1246
01:53:41.824 --> 01:53:43.724
This time he ran
off with the handcuffs.

1247
01:53:44.660 --> 01:53:46.855
What will we tell the government?
Where's the handcuffs gone?

1248
01:53:46.929 --> 01:53:48.624
Should I go after him?
- No.

1249
01:53:48.997 --> 01:53:50.123
Go order some tea.

1250
01:53:51.200 --> 01:53:53.031
He's on a 1 0 minute parole.

1251
01:53:53.168 --> 01:53:54.760
After that he goes back in again.

1252
01:53:55.204 --> 01:53:57.035
His time starts now.

1253
01:54:27.636 --> 01:54:29.536
Sorry, Saru. I am late.

1254
01:54:30.906 --> 01:54:34.034
Why are you crying? Are you okay?

1255
01:54:35.911 --> 01:54:38.072
No... you're not fine.

1256
01:54:38.147 --> 01:54:40.547
Let's go to the hospital. Come on.

1257
01:54:40.749 --> 01:54:42.114
Right now. Come.

1258
01:54:42.684 --> 01:54:44.515
You didn't tell me that
you've been discharged.

1259
01:54:44.586 --> 01:54:47.646
Even you didn't tell
me that I am your best choice.

1260
01:54:49.958 --> 01:54:52.119
You say I am your best choice.

1261
01:54:53.228 --> 01:54:56.629
Then why did you let
me marry that Abhimanyu?

1262
01:54:56.965 --> 01:54:59.263
Saru, you're my best choice, but...

1263
01:55:00.169 --> 01:55:06.108
A criminal like me can't
be your best choice... or your dad's

1264
01:55:09.912 --> 01:55:11.209
Inder...

1265
01:55:20.622 --> 01:55:23.523
You know why life was like this.

1266
01:55:26.228 --> 01:55:29.197
So that I go not as
Saraswati Parthasaarthy...

1267
01:55:30.599 --> 01:55:32.760
...but as Saraswati Parihaar

1268
01:55:42.778 --> 01:55:44.268
Marry me, Inder.

1269
01:55:45.113 --> 01:55:47.707
Please!

1270
01:56:15.177 --> 01:56:16.838
Wound Master... Parole over.

1271
01:56:16.912 --> 01:56:17.879
Time up.

1272
01:56:24.720 --> 01:56:30.681
Don't go, please... please... please...

1273
01:56:50.279 --> 01:56:52.270
Wedding gift... from me!

1274
01:57:07.029 --> 01:57:09.054
The henna looks nice, doesn't it?

1275
01:57:14.536 --> 01:57:16.060
Should I wear a sari tomorrow?

1276
01:57:20.208 --> 01:57:21.903
What are you going to wear?

1277
01:57:25.247 --> 01:57:26.908
Wear something formal.

1278
01:57:31.086 --> 01:57:35.523
It's our wedding,
our outfits should be coordinated.

1279
01:57:38.493 --> 01:57:42.759
What? Joking.

1280
01:57:45.601 --> 01:57:47.000
Inder...

1281
01:57:48.203 --> 01:57:50.068
When I am gone...

1282
01:57:52.908 --> 01:57:55.604
...please don't put
a wreath on my picture.

1283
01:58:04.720 --> 01:58:09.657
Just bury me under a beautiful tree
In my two yards of space...

1284
01:58:11.994 --> 01:58:14.155
When one of my own
comes to visit me...

1285
01:58:15.964 --> 01:58:18.125
...l'll shower down as flowers on them

1286
01:58:56.838 --> 01:58:59.033
You won't put a wreath
on her photo anymore.

1287
01:59:01.443 --> 01:59:05.470
Why does it make
such a big difference...

1288
01:59:05.547 --> 01:59:08.573
...to a useless hooligan like you?

1289
01:59:08.650 --> 01:59:12.780
Because Saru's getting
married tomorrow... to me.

1290
01:59:18.527 --> 01:59:21.587
And this time... I didn't come here to
invite you like I did the last time.

1291
01:59:21.963 --> 01:59:23.828
In fact, I'm here to tell you...

1292
01:59:23.899 --> 01:59:28.199
...when Saru sees this wreath...
she feels hurt.

1293
01:59:29.237 --> 01:59:30.727
She cries.

1294
01:59:31.540 --> 01:59:34.100
And to stop her tears,
I can kill...

1295
01:59:35.777 --> 01:59:37.210
...and die too!

1296
01:59:45.687 --> 01:59:47.177
What do you think?

1297
01:59:47.622 --> 01:59:50.147
Will I have to use this gun, or not?

1298
01:59:53.562 --> 01:59:54.688
You won't!

1299
01:59:57.499 --> 01:59:59.057
Enough now!

1300
01:59:59.201 --> 02:00:00.532
Please.

